{"id":"c1dbef4dd15f5c64","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Orbit Equivalence Relation","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Orbit Equivalence Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Orbit Equivalence Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Orbit Equivalence Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,X,a,E,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,X,a,E,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span> (group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4OrbitEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4OrbitEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (group-action-relative predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}orbit\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4OrbitEquivalenceRelation}_S(G,\\cdot,X,a,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land a:G\\times X\\to X\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\\forall g\\in G\\;(e\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e=g)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(e,x)=x)\\Bigr)\\land\\bigl[\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(g\\cdot h,x)=a(g,a(h,x)))\\bigr]\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid\\exists g\\in G\\;(a(g,x)=y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}orbit\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4OrbitEquivalenceRelation}_S(G,\\cdot,X,a,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land a:G\\times X\\to X\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\\forall g\\in G\\;(e\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e=g)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(e,x)=x)\\Bigr)\\land\\bigl[\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(g\\cdot h,x)=a(g,a(h,x)))\\bigr]\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid\\exists g\\in G\\;(a(g,x)=y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The identity element is now existentially bound and linked to the group operation; it was formerly a free parameter hidden inside a four-place predicate.</li>\n<li>The group operation is an explicit predicate argument, so two different group structures on the same carrier cannot silently change the orbit relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$ (group predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,X,a,E,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4OrbitEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}orbit\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4OrbitEquivalenceRelation}_S(G,\\cdot,X,a,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land a:G\\times X\\to X\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Bigl(\\forall g\\in G\\;(e\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e=g)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(e,x)=x)\\Bigr)\\land\\bigl[\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(a(g\\cdot h,x)=a(g,a(h,x)))\\bigr]\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid\\exists g\\in G\\;(a(g,x)=y)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1842","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-orbit-equivalence-relation]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ed71f39f59370734"]}